          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": [],
          "text": "{\"occurrence_id\":\"ibsen-et-dukkehjem-22aa549e55c520e4\",\"core_classification\":{\"label_support\":{\"truth_conditional\":4,\"performative\":1,\"exclamatory_reflexive\":0,\"other\":0},\"confidence\":0.97,\"analysis\":\"Nora directly and unequivocally avows the cessation of her love: “Jeg elsker deg ikke mer” (“I do not love you anymore”). Its core force is overwhelmingly truth-conditional. It also weakly supports performative force because, in this confrontation, the avowal helps enact her withdrawal from the marriage, though the actual separation is established chiefly by her surrounding statements and actions. The measured, explicitly confirmed conviction provides no independent expressive/reflexive force.\",\"ambiguity\":\"There is limited ambiguity over P: the statement contributes to relational severance, but it primarily reports Nora’s settled emotional state rather than itself constituting a formal undertaking or release.\"},\"other_diagnosis\":{\"tpe_failure\":null,\"core_not_context\":null},\"utterance_status\":{\"status\":\"direct\",\"description\":\"Nora directly tells Torvald, face to face, that she no longer loves him, first confirming his formulation and then stating it herself.\"},\"contextual_interpretation\":\"The utterance occurs during Nora’s deliberate explanation of why she is leaving Torvald. She says she has never felt clearer or more certain, subsequently confirms that this is a “perfectly clear and certain” conviction, and explains that Torvald’s conduct revealed him not to be the man she had imagined. Her pain at saying it and the marriage-ending context intensify its impact but do not turn it into expressive/reflexive discharge.\" ,\"evidence\":[{\"evidence_id\":\"e1\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Nora states: “Men jeg kan ikke gjøre ved det. Jeg elsker deg ikke mer” (“But I cannot help it. I do not love you anymore”).\",\"supports\":\"Strong truth-conditional force: she presents the cessation of her love as an involuntary fact about her emotional state.\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"evidence_id\":\"e2\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"When Helmer says, “Du elsker meg ikke mer,” Nora answers, “Nei, det er just tingen” (“No, that is precisely it”).\",\"supports\":\"Her own utterance reiterates and confirms an explicitly identified proposition rather than functioning mainly as affective discharge.\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"evidence_id\":\"e3\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Asked whether this is a clear and certain conviction, Nora replies: “Ja, fullkommen klar og sikker” (“Yes, perfectly clear and certain”).\",\"supports\":\"The utterance expresses a settled, reflective judgement, strongly favoring T and providing negative evidence against E.\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"evidence_id\":\"e4\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Nora adds, “Det er derfor jeg ikke vil være her lenger” (“That is why I do not want to be here any longer”) and proceeds to leave.\",\"supports\":\"The avowal is integrated into her withdrawal from the marriage, giving weak secondary support to P, while showing that the decisive undertaking is articulated in surrounding speech and action.\",\"confidence\":0.97},{\"evidence_id\":\"e5\",\"source\":\"supplied_metadata\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"The supplied form metadata identifies the occurrence as negative, present-tense, cessative, with the temporal modifier “no longer.”\",\"supports\":\"Corroborates that the core proposition presents love as having ceased rather than making a positive declaration of attachment.\",\"confidence\":1.0}],\"background_knowledge\":{\"used\":false,\"familiarity\":\"none\",\"confidence\":null,\"contribution\":null},\"ontology_assessment\":{\"fit\":\"natural\",\"diagnosis\":\"T naturally captures the principal force, with a small P component reflecting the utterance’s role in enacted relational withdrawal. Delivery and context are adequately represented without E or O.\",\"candidate_recurrent_dimension\":null},\"notes\":null}"
        }
